  "releaseNotes": "1. Add: Adding StartDate and EndDate properties to AcademicYear and Semester class.\n 2. Add: AcademicYear.START_MONTH and AcademicYear.BASE_CALENDAR_YEAR to support customization of AcademicYear calculation.\n 3. Add: Semester.FIRST_SEMESTER_START_MONTH and Semester.SECOND_SEMESTER_START_MONTH to support customization of Semester calculation.",
